"background": "A softly blurred outdoor garden or patio setting fills the upper and rear portions of the frame, dominated by pale green foliage and circular sunlit bokeh. A darker leafy branch spreads across the upper left corner, while a bright white bench or railing runs behind the subject and continues diagonally through the middle ground, reinforcing the airy high-key setting.",
