"desc": "A young East Asian woman with a small softly rounded face, large dark eyes looking directly at the camera, straight relaxed brows, a short delicate nose, and slightly parted lips forming a clear natural smile that shows the upper teeth. Her head stays nearly upright with only a faint tilt toward the raised-camera side. She leans forward from the waist and angles her torso slightly to the right, creating a compact intimate pose. Her left arm lifts upward so the hand holds a camera beside her face, while her right arm bends downward in front of her body and rests lower in the frame. She has very long straight black hair with wispy blunt bangs across the forehead and long lengths draping over both shoulders and down past the chest, with a few loose strands catching the light. She wears a loose white short-sleeved dress with a small scattered dark micro-print, soft lightweight fabric, and a relaxed silhouette. A slim gold bracelet is visible near the left wrist.",
